OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny early brightness in the
OL,6,Feast soon fading with thickening cloud
OL,7,Fand patchy rain developing during the
OL,8,Fmorning. The odd heavy burst in the
OL,9,Fafternoon but turning drier and
OL,10,Fbrighter again by evening. Windy at
OL,11,Ftimes.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FOccasional showers this
OL,14,Fevening, these most widespread through
OL,15,Fthe Trossachs and west. Mainly dry
OL,16,Fovernight with isolated showers in the
OL,17,Fwest, clear skies at times across
OL,18,FDundee and the east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
