OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FIt will be mainly dry and
OL,6,Fbright with some sunny spells. A
OL,7,Fscattering of showers developing and
OL,8,Fwinds mainly moderate from the west or
OL,9,Fsouthwest.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FWet
OL,12,Fand windy early on Saturday, turning
OL,13,Fdrier and brighter from the west.
OL,14,FMainly dry and bright on Sunday then
OL,15,Fcloudy with outbreaks of rain on
OL,16,FMonday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
